{"path":"/web-design-galway/","slug":"web-design-galway","kind":"landing","title":"Website Design Galway | Webflow Enterprise Partner","description":"Website design in Galway from a Webflow Enterprise partner. Clear service pages, tested enquiry forms and monthly reporting for established businesses.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/web-design-galway.SplDTxj1.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"wai-hero\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"wai-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq></div><div class=\"container wai-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Web Design Galway</span><h1 class=\"wai-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Website design Galway businesses can measure.</h1><p class=\"wai-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Website design in Galway for established businesses that need more useful enquiries. We build and maintain the site, connect it with search and Google Ads, and report on enquiry sources and results each month.</p><div class=\"wai-hero__badge\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq></div><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Lead generation website Galway</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>Lead generation websites for Galway businesses</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>A lead generation website gives Galway buyers a clear service offer, evidence of relevant work and a working enquiry route. We plan each service page around the question a prospect needs answered, test the form on a phone, and connect enquiries to their source where consent and tracking allow.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/case-studies/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>See our website projects<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Discuss a Galway website<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>From visit to enquiry</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>What the website needs to generate leads</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Agree what counts as a useful enquiry before the build. A form submission becomes meaningful when the team can review the request and see whether it fits the business.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A page for each important service</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Explain the offer, area served, evidence of relevant work and next step. Search and advertising should take a visitor to the page that answers their request.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A form that reaches the right person</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Ask for the details needed to assess the enquiry. Test mobile completion, validation, delivery and the confirmation message before launch.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Reporting tied to useful enquiries</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Record completed enquiries and their landing pages where measurement allows. Review enquiry quality with the business, then decide which pages or campaigns need work.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section tier\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"tier__head\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>What We Look After</span><h2 class=\"tier__heading\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Website, Google Ads and Search, Run by One Galway Team</h2><p class=\"tier__intro\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A website on its own does very little for a local business. It earns its keep when the Google Ads point at the right pages, the search work brings people who were already looking, and someone reports every month on how many enquiries all of it produced.</p></div><div class=\"tier__grid\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><article class=\"tier-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>The website</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A Webflow build your own staff can edit, or an existing site taken over and looked after. Either way its job is enquiries, and how many it brought is in the monthly report rather than a mystery.</p></article><article class=\"tier-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Google Ads</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Campaigns set up, watched and adjusted continuously, so budget goes to the searches that turn into enquiries. The spend and the results sit in the monthly report beside everything else, and nothing runs unwatched.</p></article><article class=\"tier-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Search visibility</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Search engine optimisation and visibility in AI answers, run as one discipline. When someone in Galway asks Google or ChatGPT for what you sell, the work is making sure you are the answer they get.</p></article><article class=\"tier-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>One team, one report</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>The site, the ads and the search work depend on each other, so one team runs all three and one report each month says what they did. You have one number to call and one document to read.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section audience\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A Galway Client</span><h2 class=\"audience__heading\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Stira: a Galway Manufacturer We Have Looked After for Years</h2><div class=\"audience__grid\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><article class=\"audience-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Stira has made attic stairs in Dunmore since 1982.</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>They sell across Ireland and the UK, through the website and through direct enquiry. We run their Google Ads, look after their search engine optimisation and their visibility in AI answers, and take on the website work as it comes up.</p></article><article class=\"audience-card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>We oversee Stira’s organic and paid search as one account.</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Google Ads, search engine optimisation and visibility in AI answers, run together and reported together, so a Galway manufacturer selling across two markets has one team accountable for where its enquiries come from. That is what a local engagement with us looks like.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Who This Suits</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Who We Work With in Galway</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Most of our roster is B2B software companies in Ireland, the UK and the US. Locally, we take on a small number of businesses where the fit is right, and we say so plainly when it is not.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Established Galway businesses</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Manufacturers, professional services, specialist trades and firms with a real customer base, where the website should be bringing enquiries and someone senior wants to know each month whether it did.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Businesses that want one supplier</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>If the site is with one company, the ads with another and nobody owns the search work, the three drift apart. We take all three, so there is one team to call and one report to read.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Who we are not right for</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>A five-page site for a few hundred euro, built in a week and never touched again. There are good studios in Galway for that and we will point you at them rather than quote for work we would not do well.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><h3 data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>What we are honest about</h3><p data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>We are not the cheapest option in the city. Being in Galway means we can meet in person and work your hours. The monthly report is where the work itself is judged, and it is the document you show whoever asks what the spend produced.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section proof\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"proof__head\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Proof</span><h2 class=\"proof__heading\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>What This Looks Like on a Live Engagement</h2></div><div class=\"proof__grid\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><div class=\"proof-stat\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"proof-stat__value\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Since 1982</span><span class=\"proof-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Stira Folding Attic Stairs, Dunmore, Co. Galway, has been making attic stairs. We have looked after their Google Ads and search visibility for years</span></div><div class=\"proof-stat\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><span class=\"proof-stat__value\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Organic and paid</span><span class=\"proof-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>search traffic overseen for Stira as one account: Google Ads, search engine optimisation and visibility in AI answers</span></div><div class=\"proof-stat\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"proof-stat__value\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>18+ months</span><span class=\"proof-stat__label\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>of monthly reporting, held in the same format, for our longest-running account</span></div></div><p class=\"proof__foot\" data-astro-cid-2empv5tq>Measured on live client engagements. Every other figure stays anonymous until that client clears being named.</p></div></section><section class=\"greviews\" data-review-band-state=\"live\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><div class=\"container greviews__inner\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><div class=\"greviews__summary\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><span class=\"greviews__g\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M45.12 24.5c0-1.56-.14-3.06-.4-4.5H24v8.51h11.84c-.51 2.75-2.06 5.08-4.39 6.64v5.52h7.11c4.16-3.83 6.56-9.47 6.56-16.17z\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp></path><path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M24 46c5.94 0 10.92-1.97 14.56-5.33l-7.11-5.52c-1.97 1.32-4.49 2.1-7.45 2.1-5.73 0-10.58-3.87-12.31-9.07H4.34v5.7C7.96 41.07 15.4 46 24 46z\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp></path><path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M11.69 28.18C11.25 26.86 11 25.45 11 24s.25-2.86.69-4.18v-5.7H4.34C2.85 17.09 2 20.45 2 24s.85 6.91 2.34 9.88l7.35-5.7z\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp></path><path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M24 10.75c3.23 0 6.13 1.11 8.41 3.29l6.31-6.31C34.91 4.18 29.93 2 24 2 15.4 2 7.96 6.93 4.34 14.12l7.35 5.7c1.73-5.2 6.58-9.07 12.31-9.07z\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp></path></svg></span><div class=\"greviews__figures\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><span class=\"greviews__stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><svg class=\"is-filled\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-astro-cid-yrxfijmp><path d=\"M12 2.6l2.93 5.94 6.56.95-4.75 4.63 1.12 6